message: "If you use this dataset or these scripts, please cite them as below."
title: "Lightning routing cost of capital: dataset and collection scripts"
version: "1.0"
type: dataset
date-released: 2026-09-13
authors:
  - family-names: Mikhrin
    given-names: Eduard
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-6104-4368"
    affiliation: 'National Technical University of Ukraine "Igor Sikorsky Kyiv Polytechnic Institute", Kyiv, Ukraine'
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Reproducible snapshot dataset and collection scripts for an assessment of a
  Lightning Network routing node as an investment. Raw responses from the
  mempool.space, Amboss and CoinGecko public APIs are stored verbatim with UTC
  timestamps and SHA-256 hashes, and the derived tables — cost of capital,
  node-size scenarios and an APY sensitivity grid — are rebuilt from them by a
  single command. Snapshot of 2026-09-13.
keywords:
  - Lightning Network
  - Bitcoin
  - payment channels
  - routing node
  - cost of capital
  - liquidity market
  - reproducible research
